{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Test Your Luck!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build the ultimate slot machine, pick every symbol, and fine-tune every jackpot. Face off\u2014beard to beard\u2014against rival dwarves in a high-stakes battle to claim the <strong>Last Forge</strong> as your own!<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348880/extras/Slot.gif?t=1743176030\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Zeppelin Full of Wares</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stack the odds in your favor with over <strong>200 rare and legendary symbols!</strong> Lock in key items for later, remove unwanted symbols to refine your strategy, or reroll the shop for a fresh selection after every battle. Craft the perfect slot machine and outplay the competition!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348880/extras/Zeplin.gif?t=1743176030\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Powerful Skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every loss is an opportunity to grow stronger. Unlock powerful abilities that reshape your strategy\u2014trigger massive jackpots, curse your opponents, or supercharge your economy. Adapt, strategize, and turn the tides in your favor! <br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348880/extras/SkillCards.gif?t=1743176030\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Show off Your Success!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn experience from every fight and unlock cosmetics to flaunt your victories. With seasonal rewards and a rotating pool of symbols, every run is unique\u2014all <strong>without</strong> microtransactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348880/extras/ChangingSkins.gif?t=1743176030\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"h